    <Folder>
      <name>Presso le case</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Vallene</name>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR480r2eRj2bbSs5benq-JiIdfqHjHhooQrIxEcK-iQquYnd-D3xGi1mI5j80fTCit4J_Be2xzb45fC8zok4QLNVyFNiZBkgA94hhJpZOEm3Ar2K6O4uWHmOus5yozgsF5S5aq8TYJxSbcIBGtlOhU1Cr5SiJM8D_GM1XXRRtzk-iUSy0qtY4TDodxYlMnxUGfx2GPLE1-qqhEpJztW4TcMF228R4gGl3delub-zXVCVrzaP_mluOTASS1s?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1/06/2026 - Vallene di Terlago (Vallelaghi),  giugno: un orso è fotografato mentre cammina a fianco di un’abitazione prossima al bosco</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1603-4E342E</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value>https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR480r2eRj2bbSs5benq-JiIdfqHjHhooQrIxEcK-iQquYnd-D3xGi1mI5j80fTCit4J_Be2xzb45fC8zok4QLNVyFNiZBkgA94hhJpZOEm3Ar2K6O4uWHmOus5yozgsF5S5aq8TYJxSbcIBGtlOhU1Cr5SiJM8D_GM1XXRRtzk-iUSy0qtY4TDodxYlMnxUGfx2GPLE1-qqhEpJztW4TcMF228R4gGl3delub-zXVCVrzaP_mluOTASS1s?fife=s16383</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            11.0475222,46.1087088,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Cadine</name>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR79Vajt0R5FiceORX-lp6Ono-pRowHtBN1lOtfOKfwMVcXQcEyYHrJGjtDTGDR7LqO-Pfu_irq3bhpcZcuTWejzIL_VCe6Y7MXDDKzh4kWoT_E8X8DYRZrWnueoiXmY7fshXNi6jwsBC6BvAzs_jBOzmXnd9sV38JMQ5Is5vLM5yNpTAAzUnxeBvqhwaTV4Q82m6QtVMuZDvZ2AZZKEHjVuPANsTXqbBm7yO6WwQUPwZjxnOAT9ZtFV7lg?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;27/05/2026 - Una donna, PERSON_0001, ai bordi del paese riprende un orso nell'orto sottostante casa sua. La forestale, solo dopo che il video è finito sui social e dai social è rimbalzato sui quotidiani trentini comunica ufficialmente (ma erano passate due settimane) che l'orso era apparso nello stesso posto anche il 30/05/2026. Ma se è problematico cosa hanno fatto?</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1603-4E342E</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value>https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR79Vajt0R5FiceORX-lp6Ono-pRowHtBN1lOtfOKfwMVcXQcEyYHrJGjtDTGDR7LqO-Pfu_irq3bhpcZcuTWejzIL_VCe6Y7MXDDKzh4kWoT_E8X8DYRZrWnueoiXmY7fshXNi6jwsBC6BvAzs_jBOzmXnd9sV38JMQ5Is5vLM5yNpTAAzUnxeBvqhwaTV4Q82m6QtVMuZDvZ2AZZKEHjVuPANsTXqbBm7yO6WwQUPwZjxnOAT9ZtFV7lg?fife=s16383</value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            11.0661725,46.0864405,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Barnèl</name>
        <description>maggio 2026. Comune di Cimbergo. Un orso penetra in un pollaio ma si accontenta di portare via un secchio di mangime</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1603-000000</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            10.3779452,46.0254864,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
